{"title":"Lizper","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 40 Lizper that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (2.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .3 | venomDamage: 14 | venomDurationMs: 8e3</p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=40\">Lv 40</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>40</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>36</td><td>in the wilds around 2389, 734</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>40</td><td>in the wilds around 2393, 733</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around 2672, 891</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"lizper\" data-map-level=\"43\">Show level 43 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 312 total, 23–48 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-fang\" title=\"Lizper Fang - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/89d4e7d9ed1f4718097e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-scale\" title=\"Lizper Scale - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b79092ee4a292010c666.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-mace\" title=\"Gold Mace - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/163910b1c1e523fad89b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2393, 737 <span class=\"muted\">· 36 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2527, 763 <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2404, 658 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2661, 877 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2320, 764 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"lizper\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Lizper: <a href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter\">Lizper Spitter</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/3765090b26ea5af52165.webp\" alt=\"Lizper\"></div><h3>Lizper</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>43</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 40)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Lizper</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>222</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>28.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>68 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}